flowchart TB
    accTitle: Capability Runner architecture
    accDescr: A React interface and command line invoke one Python backend. Discovery uses a model and compiles and validates traces into JSON artifacts. Replay reads those artifacts without a model. Both engines use the Action Gateway with policy and session checks, then the Playwright browser adapter. Action evidence is recorded locally.

    UI["React UI / CLI"]
    LLM["Configured LLM provider"]

    subgraph Backend["Single Python backend"]
        Run["Run orchestration"]
        Discover["Discovery + Model Client"]
        Replay["Replay + state checks"]
        Gateway["Action Gateway + control checks"]
        Browser["Playwright adapter"]
    end

    subgraph Files["Local persistence"]
        Artifact[("Capability JSON + profile")]
        Evidence[("Sanitized JSONL")]
    end

    Target["Target web app"]

    UI -->|"goal / workflow"| Run
    Run -->|"discover"| Discover
    Run -->|"replay"| Replay
    LLM -->|"action proposals"| Discover
    Discover -->|"compile + validate"| Artifact
    Replay -->|"load saved steps"| Artifact
    Discover -->|"proposals"| Gateway
    Replay -->|"saved steps"| Gateway
    Gateway -->|"authorized actions"| Browser
    Gateway -->|"events"| Evidence
    Browser <-->|"actions / state"| Target
